<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16">
  <div class="text-center mb-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-primary mb-4">{{ page.title | default: 'Terms & Conditions' }}</h1>
    <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-secondary mx-auto rounded-full mb-6"></div>
    <p class="text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      This page covers the core legal contract, order modifications, cancellation rules, and legal jurisdiction.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
    
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Order Modifications</h2>
        <p>No changes, alterations, or modifications to an order will be accepted within 24 hours of the scheduled delivery time. For modifications prior to this window, please write to <a href="mailto:orders@floralindia.com" class="text-secondary hover:underline font-medium">orders@floralindia.com</a> or connect via our Live Chat.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Cancellation & Fee Policy</h2>
        <p>If an order is canceled within 72 hours of the scheduled delivery time, a <strong class="text-red-600">50% cancellation fee</strong> will be charged.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Availability-Based Cancellation</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to cancel an order within 24 hours of receiving it if the product is unavailable within a 5km radius of your delivery region. If the order was placed less than 24 hours before the delivery slot, the sender will be updated promptly via SMS, Email, or phone.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Public Holidays</h2>
        <p>If the requested delivery date falls on a public holiday, the product may be delivered one day prior or one day after.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Delay Due to Unforeseen Circumstances</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">While Floral India strives to ensure timely delivery of every order, delays may occasionally occur due to circumstances beyond our reasonable control, including severe weather conditions, heavy rainfall, floods, storms, natural disasters, traffic disruptions, government restrictions, strikes, public emergencies, or other unforeseen events.</p>
        <p>In such situations, Floral India shall not be held liable for any delay in delivery. Orders will be delivered at the earliest possible opportunity once normal operations resume. Such delays shall not qualify for cancellation, refund, or compensation, as they arise from circumstances beyond our control.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Legal Jurisdiction</h2>
        <p>All legal disputes and legalities will be addressed and handled exclusively under the Delhi jurisdiction only.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Policy Updates</h2>
        <p>Terms and conditions are subject to change without prior notice.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Terms & Conditions",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
